  "slug": "incoming-material-change-request-form",
  "title": "Incoming Material Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Compare current and proposed incoming material controls, assess affected work, predefine evidence, authorize a transition boundary, implement, and verify results.",
  "description": "A controlled incoming material change request form for changing the supplier receipt inspection without losing revision traceability, impact ownership, pre-implementation evidence, transition control, rollback readiness, post-change verification, or receiving handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use before altering the purchase order, material specification, and sampling instruction or its execution when the proposed state must be assessed, approved, introduced at a clear effective boundary, and verified before closeout.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
